From eaa1a899b336af3c43926878f2d752c7d48f64d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devesh Rai <devesh.rai@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:03:22 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 30/42] Integrated autorouter on Android (Route > Autoroute
 Board)

The Android app carries Freerouting's routing core, run in the app's own Java
runtime.  The new action exports the board as Specctra DSN, routes it on a
background thread, and imports the session.  While it routes, the routes found
so far are shown on the board.  Every import goes into one undo step, so
Discard (or Undo) puts the board back as it was.

- kiplatform/autorouter.h, os/android/autorouter.cpp: JNI bridge to
  io.github.deveshrai.kicadandroid.Autorouter
- dialogs/dialog_autoroute.cpp: options, progress and Keep/Discard
- PCB_ACTIONS::autorouteBoard, in the Route menu when the router is there

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
